cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper listed below."
title: "percolation-design: Monte Carlo percolation engine and cost-optimal design code for binary conductive filler blends"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of a soft-core continuum percolation engine for
  mixed spherocylinder/sphere systems in a thin cell between two electrodes,
  together with the calibration, surrogate-constraint and cost-optimisation
  workflow described in the accompanying paper.
